[{"difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"负数表示的是什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"与正数意义相反的量"},{"key":"B","text":"比 100 大的数"},{"key":"C","text":"只能表示温度，不能表示别的"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"收入可以用正数，支出可以用负数。","id":"cnm_p201_q1","topicId":"cnm_p201"},{"difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"温度零下用什么数表示？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"负数表示"},{"key":"B","text":"只能用 0"},{"key":"C","text":"用大于 10 的数"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"零下 3 度记作 -3。","id":"cnm_p201_q2","topicId":"cnm_p201"},{"difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"温度从零上 3 度降到零下 2 度。下降了多少度？","answer":"5","explanation":"从＋3 到 －2，下降 3＋2＝5（度）。","verify":"3+2","id":"cnm_p201_q3","topicId":"cnm_p201"},{"difficulty":"challenge","type":"numeric","prompt":"某天最高气温 5℃，最低气温 －3℃。这一天的温差是多少摄氏度？","answer":"8","explanation":"温差是最高减最低：5－(－3)＝8。","verify":"5-(-3)","id":"cnm_p201_q4","topicId":"cnm_p201"},{"difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"小明收入 8 元记作＋8 元，支出 5 元记作－5 元。他先收入 8 元，又支出 5 元，结余多少元？","answer":"3","explanation":"＋8＋(－5)＝3。","verify":"8-5","id":"cnm_p202_q1","topicId":"cnm_p202"},{"difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"潜水员以水面为 0 米，向下 6 米记作－6 米。他先下潜 6 米，又继续下潜 3 米，现在在水面下多少米？","answer":"9","explanation":"两次下潜，6＋3＝9（米）。","verify":"6+3","id":"cnm_p202_q2","topicId":"cnm_p202"},{"difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"电梯从起点上升 12 层，又下降 5 层。现在比起点高多少层？","answer":"7","explanation":"12－5＝7。","verify":"12-5","id":"cnm_p202_q3","topicId":"cnm_p202"},{"difficulty":"challenge","type":"numeric","prompt":"海拔：海平面记作 0 米，山顶比海平面高 1200 米记作＋1200 米。一块盆地比海平面低 80 米，应记作多少米？（带符号）","answer":"-80","explanation":"比海平面低记作负数，－80 米。","verify":"-80","id":"cnm_p202_q4","topicId":"cnm_p202"}]
